{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is visible, move towards and grab it. Inspect the object properties. If approached, grab and inspect. Finally, scan the area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
